  "question": {
    "text": "An organic compound X is oxidized by using acidified <math><msub><mrow><mtext>K</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mtext>C</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msub></math> . The product obtained reacts with phenyl hydrazine, but does not answer silver mtextrror test. The possible structure of X is",
    "image": null
  },
